OL,3,AOfficials giving update after four
OL,4,Akilled and dozens injured in Canadian
OL,5,Amilitary base fire
OL,6,
OL,7,FFour people have been killed and 39
OL,8,Fmore taken to hospital after a major
OL,9,Ffire at a Canadian military base -
OL,10,Fwatch live above as officials give an
OL,11,Fupdate
OL,13,FAt least 19 of those in hospital are in
OL,14,Fa critical condition after Saturday's
OL,15,Ffire, officials say
OL,17,FCarney says the "violent, fast-moving"
OL,18,Ffire led to "one of the worst
OL,19,Ftragedies" for the military in
OL,20,Fpeacetime
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
