OL,3,AOfficials giving update after four
OL,4,Akilled and dozens injured in Canadian
OL,5,Amilitary base fire
OL,6,
OL,7,F"It was like a scene out of a war
OL,8,Fmovie," says a hospital resident who
OL,9,Fwitnessed a military vehicle and
OL,10,Fambulances bringing injured people in
OL,12,FA defence spokesperson says that, while
OL,13,Finvestigations are under way, "at this
OL,14,Ftime, there are no indications that it
OL,15,Fwas the result of any terrorist
OL,16,Factivity"
OL,18,FCanadian Forces Base Wainwright, where
OL,19,Fthe fire broke out about 16:00 local
OL,20,Ftime (22:00 GMT) on Saturday, is one of
OL,21,Fthe country's busiest military training
OL,22,Fbases
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
